{"id":"1272f2abca26252c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-computable-fixedpoint-set.md","title":"每个全可计算变换有无限可计算固定点集","display":"thm-computable-fixedpoint-set — 每个全可计算变换有无限可计算固定点集","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-computable-fixedpoint-set","aliases":["20-thm-computable-fixedpoint-set"],"display":"thm-computable-fixedpoint-set — 每个全可计算变换有无限可计算固定点集","chapter":"2","section":"2.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Proposition 2.2.5","source_printed_pages":[31],"source_pdf_pages":[67],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler]]","[[20-lem-padding]]","[[20-thm-ce-computable-subset]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-computable-fixedpoint-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-computable-fixedpoint-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-computable-fixedpoint-set — 每个全可计算变换有无限可计算固定点集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Proposition 2.2.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>31</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f694412375e5760d\" href=\"?note=f694412375e5760d\" title=\"20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler\">20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0be375ec387418e3\" href=\"?note=0be375ec387418e3\" title=\"20-thm-ce-computable-subset\">20-thm-ce-computable-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f694412375e5760d\" href=\"?note=f694412375e5760d\" title=\"20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler\">20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0be375ec387418e3\" href=\"?note=0be375ec387418e3\" title=\"20-thm-ce-computable-subset\">20-thm-ce-computable-subset</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}computable\\text{-}fixedpoint\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\exists F\\in\\mathcal R\\ [|F|=\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in F\\ \\varphi_n=\\varphi_{f(n)}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}computable\\text{-}fixedpoint\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\exists F\\in\\mathcal R\\ [|F|=\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in F\\ \\varphi_n=\\varphi_{f(n)}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>f 的一个索引 e 可被 padding 为无限不同索引；将这些索引送入单射固定点编译器 g，得到无限 c.e. 固定点集合。上游无限 c.e. 子集定理给其中的无限可计算子集 F。这里按函数外延相等，不要求 f(n)=n。</p>\n<p>来源：Proposition 2.2.5；印刷页 31；PDF 第 67 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler","status":"resolved","id":"f694412375e5760d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ce-computable-subset","status":"resolved","id":"0be375ec387418e3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-ce-computable-subset]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler","status":"resolved","id":"f694412375e5760d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-ce-computable-subset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-ce-computable-subset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ce-computable-subset","status":"resolved","id":"0be375ec387418e3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-uniform-fixedpoint-compiler]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-ce-computable-subset]]。","embed":false},